<http://data.silknow.org/object/895bb04a-74c3-300b-a5a1-52a0e016e150>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Scarf of brocaded silk, Spitalfields, ca. 1815-1823"@en , "Scarf made of brocaded silk. The scarf is of white tabby with a ribbed 0.5 inch wide selvedge, with ribbing repeated as an end feature at either end of the scarf. Above this is a meandering band of small six-petalled flowers brocaded in pink silk with green centres on a stem of white leaves formed by the weft bound in fancy twills by a portion of the warp, and the remainder floats on the back. Above this band are three brocaded sprays of small pink flowers in a cluster of green leaves. Above these are two smaller similar sprays."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/195bfe5f-9608-3857-bd93-3683208f428c> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Scarf made of brocaded silk. The scarf is of white tabby with a ribbed 0.5 inch wide selvedge, with ribbing repeated as an end feature at either end of the scarf. Above this is a meandering band of small six-petalled flowers brocaded in pink silk with green centres on a stem of white leaves formed by the weft bound in fancy twills by a portion of the warp, and the remainder floats on the back. Above this band are three brocaded sprays of small pink flowers in a cluster of green leaves. Above these are two smaller similar sprays."@en , "Scarf of brocaded silk, Spitalfields, ca. 1815-1823"@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/895bb04a-74c3-300b-a5a1-52a0e016e150/dimension/1> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/895bb04a-74c3-300b-a5a1-52a0e016e150/dimension/2> ;
